{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.unfold\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">unfold</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declNames</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameSet\">NameSet</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.DSimproc\">DSimproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Unfolds the applications of the definitions in `declNames`, like `Meta.simp` does for the\ndefinitions provided in `simp [f]`. A definition with smart unfolding support is unfolded only\nwhen its recursion argument reduces. Any other definition is unfolded only when applied to at\nleast as many arguments as its number of leading lambdas.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.unfold","kind":"def","line":38,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.unfold","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.lean#L38-L52"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpMatch\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">dsimpMatch</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.DSimproc\">DSimproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpMatch","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpMatch","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.lean#L35-L36"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpProj\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">dsimpProj</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.DSimproc\">DSimproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpProj","kind":"def","line":32,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.dsimpProj","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.lean#L32-L33"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.zeta\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">zeta</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.DSimproc\">DSimproc</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.zeta","kind":"def","line":29,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.zeta","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/Reduce.lean#L29-L30"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta